    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;HoloCall&quot; is a fan-made music rhythm game inspired by hololive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose your favorite hololive songs to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, notes fall along with the rhythm. You need to press the keys in time with the notes and rhythm, and shout out the calls using your microphone when prompted to score high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each song offers four difficulty levels, allowing everyone, from rhythm beginners to experts, to enjoy the fun of cheering and calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those unfamiliar with hololive, we hope you'll discover its charm through our energetic, heart-moving songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > For hololive fans, this game serves as a practice tool for live concert calls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for those who couldn't get concert tickets, we hope this game provides some comfort and lets you experience the unity of a live venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bPowered by &quot;CRIWARE&quot;.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;HoloCall&quot; is a fan-made music rhythm game inspired by hololive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose your favorite hololive songs to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, notes fall along with the rhythm. You need to press the keys in time with the notes and rhythm, and shout out the calls using your microphone when prompted to score high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each song offers four difficulty levels, allowing everyone, from rhythm beginners to experts, to enjoy the fun of cheering and calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those unfamiliar with hololive, we hope you'll discover its charm through our energetic, heart-moving songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > For hololive fans, this game serves as a practice tool for live concert calls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for those who couldn't get concert tickets, we hope this game provides some comfort and lets you experience the unity of a live venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bPowered by &quot;CRIWARE&quot;.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>",
